files/RUNNER-SETUP.md <-- files/RUNNER-SETUP-SUMMARY.md, files/RUNNER-QUICK-REFERENCE.md
files/complete_documentation.md <-- files/complete_documentation.pdf
devops-tools-backend/docs/README.md <-- README.md (root)
.github/copilot-instructions.md <-- AGENTS.md (if overlap found in future)
